  "answer_text": "Here are some of the best places to find the latest stock market news:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcc8 Top Sources for Stock Market News\n\n1. **[CNBC](https://www.cnbc.com/)** \u2013 One of the most comprehensive financial news sources. Recent headlines include stories on the jobs report and its market impact, the 10-year Treasury yield surging above 4.53%, Meta's stock movement, and Marvell Technology and Flex joining the S&P 500 index.\n\n2. **[Yahoo Finance](https://finance.yahoo.com/)** \u2013 A go-to hub for live quotes, business news, and financial data. Recent coverage includes chip stocks shedding more than $1 trillion in market value as the AI trade buckled, and what the sell-off signals for the broader market.\n\n3. **[CNN Markets](https://www.cnn.com/markets)** \u2013 Provides up-to-date stock market data coverage, including the latest updates on US markets, world markets, stock quotes, crypto, commodities, and currencies.\n\n---\n\n### Other Reliable Options:\n- **Bloomberg** (bloomberg.com) \u2013 In-depth financial analysis and breaking market news.\n- **MarketWatch** (marketwatch.com) \u2013 Real-time stock data and financial news.\n- **Reuters** (reuters.com/finance) \u2013 Global financial and business news.\n- **The Wall Street Journal** (wsj.com) \u2013 Premium financial journalism.\n- **Investing.com** \u2013 Real-time data, charts, and market news.\n\nFor the most up-to-date information, I'd recommend bookmarking **CNBC**, **Yahoo Finance**, or **Bloomberg**, as they update their market coverage continuously throughout the trading day.",
